WEBVTT

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.650
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
especially now…

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
ima koso

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
forever

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
itsudemo

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:36.150
October 25th, 1945.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.410
Note: GHQ = General Headquarters of the Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.410
The GHQ’s Supreme Commander of the allied forces, MacArthur,

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:43.120
Note: Zaibatsu = Japanese financial cartel.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:43.120
ordered the Japanese Zaibatsu to be dismantled.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.430
And, to enforce restrictions
on production,

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:50.150
he ordered all concerned parties to report the details of their businesses.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:56.450
There was a GHQ memorandum concerning the top financial institutions and manufacturers.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.940
It was the so-called “dismantlement of the Zaibatsu.”

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:05.020
However, the leaders of the Zaibatsu hid their assets underground

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.370
and created a top secret research facility.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.600
It was named the Wadatsumi Facility.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.570
Backed by abundant capital, it controlled both politics and the economy from the shadows

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.990
during the postwar period,
and continued its forbidden research.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.410
That research was called the “Ikaros Project.”

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.850
Any outsiders who knew of its existence lost their lives.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.910
The Ikaros Project was surrounded by murder and conspiracy.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:32.420
Secret postwar records indicate heretical research, including experiments on living people.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.850
It was an ingenious program to manipulate the psyche of the general public,

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:42.430
and its ultimate result was the combination of human and squid DNA - an evil new humanoid.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.970
It was the birth of Ika Fire.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.680
IKA!

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.550
The shopping district!

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:59.740
Rentarou!!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.950
Damn! That squid!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.650
To all those who are watching on TV!

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.150
This is not a movie!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.080
This… is not a movie!

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.550
I won’t let ya do whatever ya want!!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.550
Yoohoo…

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.600
You bastard!!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:45.350
I’ve come to kick the crap out of ya!

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.100
There! There! There!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.080
There, there, there, there, there!!!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.880
Ika… What did you do?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.300
Does it hurt? Is it painful?

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.250
You can’t hit me!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.940
COME ON!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:23.660
I’m gonna whoop you all the way back to Saga Prefecture Naruko Town!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:32.200
Take this puh-lease!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:39.600
He…

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.590
He did it!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.930
Its bark is worse than its bite.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.180
No…

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.400
…way!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.400
Geez, you just went and overdid it.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.400
And now…

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.740
Se-Senpai!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.850
Whoops.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.900
Another spirited blockhead.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:10.400
But I’m more interested in that guy over there.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.750
It’s not that I have any grudge against you personally,

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.750
but I’ve got a beef with you father.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.950
I won’t kill you right away.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.100
I’ll burn everything
that is important to you.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.550
The office, the bath house person, then the meat shop lady,

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.720
then the ladies and gents working in the shopping district, and finally…

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.600
…the girl.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:43.490
Squid… The squid’s gone!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.700
Calling all squads.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.880
The squid is heading in the direction of the city.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.770
Those forming the barrier should enter high alert status.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.510
H-Hey! Rentarou!

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:06.850
That squid… Soujyu… and all the people of the shopping street…

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.350
Give it up!

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:12.050
He’s not an opponent that we can just take on, even with our best efforts.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.950
Even if you don’t go, no one will speak badly of you.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.310
Err, no… They won’t be able to.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.020
Soujyu will…

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.030
That squid bastard… He’s gonna… Soujyu…

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.850
It’s impossible!

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.240
What can you do against a monster that can’t be hurt with guns or bombs?!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.000
It’s not something where you can just do your best and expect it to be fine!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.050
It’s impossible! Just forget it…

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:42.300
I’ve already let something precious slip away once.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.990
There’s no way I can let the same thing happen again.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:55.950
Rentarou!

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.700
A man who doesn’t measure up…

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.550
will use violence to lash out at things when the opportunity arises.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.200
You’ll take responsibility and protect her?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.900
How are you going to do that?

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.000
How long are you going to continue what you’re going?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.450
Ten years? Twenty years? Until something tangible happens?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.200
The savings accounts?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.040
The insurance?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.700
I don’t have any.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:20.800
But hey…

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.550
Are you really living to the fullest?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:24.700
I am!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:30.510
The creature that we had believed to be destroyed is flying eastward.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.910
We are currently showing you the site

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.500
where the fight between the squid and the police took place.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.350
The police force has been annihilated.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.830
Trashed police bikes are scattered all over the place.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.850
Ah, there’s one policeman!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:47.500
We’ll get staff onsite who can confirm all this.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.050
Studio! Studio!

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.650
I’m reporting from the Nikotama main highway.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.870
There’s movement!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.800
It seems like that police bike is chasing after the squid!

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.550
It’s a… civilian…

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.300
It’s a civilian!

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.420
He’s currently recklessly pursuing the squid!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.850
I-Isn’t that Nidaime?

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:05.950
Nidaime?

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:09.350
The man on the police bike has taken out a mobile phone.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.930
Who is he trying to call?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.640
Rentarou!

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.450
Soujyu? It’s me!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:23.520
Are you all right?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.360
Y-Yes.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.200
Thank goodness.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.820
I’m watching you
on the television right now.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.550
This is way too dangerous.

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.650
Please stop.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:40.830
Come back. If you were to disappear, I…

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.100
I… don’t want to be all alone.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.000
I’m scared, Rentarou.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.800
Let’s go somewhere together… We’ll have fun with just the two of us… Okay?

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.350
Just… please come back.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:52.340
We’re not two.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:53.250
What?

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.890
We’re not two, are we?

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.650
We are three!

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.400
If we aren’t three, then it’s no good!

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.520
Isn’t that right? Isn’t that right, Soujyu?

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:06.500
Yes.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.650
So, believe in me and wait for me!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:12.800
Yes!

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.030
Let’s go to the bath house,

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:17.850
take a stroll,

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.460
wait for a phone call that will never come,

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.500
and chase after a UFO!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:36.600
Yeah.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.150
Found ya!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.730
Run all you want.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:49.610
Don’t underestimate me!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.830
The squid is approaching you.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.370
The plan is to fire at will.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.290
Fire at will once the squid reaches the barricade.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.300
It’s coming!

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.800
I’ll take care of you.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.750
The Wrath of Nature!

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:22.650
DAAAAAAAMN!

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:28.940
Go! Go! Ika Fire!

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.350
You won’t get away!

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.300
The man on the police bike!

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.690
The man on the police bike has gone past the barricade and is chasing after the squid!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:41.700
Rentarou…

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.950
You’re trying hard…

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.920
It’s finally getting interesting.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:55.680
If you’re able to overtake me, then I’ll eat peanuts through my nose.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.680
The same move again?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.520
Same pattern again?!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.520
Really? Then…

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.020
What about peptide glucan?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.400
I’ll vaporize you!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:39.600
The squid has taken down the youth on the bike.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:42.150
All that’s left on the surface now is a sea of flames.

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:45.140
Will no one be able to stop that squid?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.150
That brat…

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:51.150
It’s all just a sea of flames everywhere on the surface.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.150
Show us Nidaime! Nidaime!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.150
Emergency countermeasures.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.450
Just now, at the parliament, they’ve started the ninth countermeasure.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:02.200
In addition, an order has been given

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.710
to douse the fires 100 kilometres around the direction the squid’s attack.

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:40.050
This is terrible.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.150
He’s not here.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:43.850
Over there?

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:45.280
I can’t see him either.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:47.100
I see.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:51.790
There!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.800
Thank goodness! Nidaime is alive!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.300
Nidaime!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.300
Are you all right?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.760
Let’s go to the hospital, quickly…

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.750
It’s enough, Nidaime.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.110
You did well.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.300
Not yet.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.660
Forward… I need to move forward…

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.990
Why are you pushing yourself like that?

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.500
They aren’t showing Nidaime.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.050
Just what happened?

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:36.950
Nidaime…

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.800
He might have died…

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.300
What are you saying?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.950
She’s worried…

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:50.400
You might be scared to find out about Nidaime’s well-being, but…

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.980
What about calling him?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:54.850
I believe…

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.730
I believe that he’s definitely coming back.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.240
He’ll defeat the squid, and come back.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.750
And then we’ll three again, with Sara-chan…

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.100
That’s why I’ll wait.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.950
I’ll believe, and wait!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.300
Nidaime!

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:28.800
Let’s come from behind, like in baseball.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.770
It’s a good time to show that you’re a man.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:34.730
Let’s go, Kinoshita!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:35.980
Freakin’ yeah!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.300
The squid’s attacking like cannon.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.600
He’s firing like cannon!

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:56.550
We are outside of his range.
Will things be okay at this rate?

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:59.170
You’re depressing!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.680
Now let’s go to that guy’s woman.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.680
Ah, run away, run away, run away!!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.360
Ika? Ikaaa?

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.690
Ikakaka.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.450
The legendary head biker!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:22.950
A one night carnival!

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.300
We saw you on TV!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.480
We’ve come to back you up!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.550
Everyone! Let’s make it hot!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:30.620
Yeah!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.580
The 16-year-old me.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.160
The excessively self-conscious and totally conceited me.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.440
W-W-What?

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.600
Senpai! Win this thing!

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:57.140
Yeah!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:58.400
Rentarou!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:15:59.800
Go!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.600
Nidaime, GO!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.400
Darnit!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.950
I hate my old self.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:23.400
I hate the me from before,
who ran away from my old self.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:28.950
The hesitating me, the me who thought he knew everything – I hate them both.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:32.850
But despite them, there’s a me that I love.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.750
I love the me who was together with Sara and Soujyu.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.500
I love the me who honestly thinks that…

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.100
the three of us doing detective work,

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.520
the three of us eating meals,

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.400
the three of us dozing off…

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:47.050
that the whole of our time together was invaluable.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:48.640
Rentarou.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:50.460
Soujyu…

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:51.700
Rentarou.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.010
Sara!

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:54.500
Rentarou.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:55.820
Rentarou.

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:57.150
Rentarou!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.300
Rentarou!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:59.550
Rentarou!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.150
Rentarou!

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:08.850
Rentarou!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:12.950
Rentarou!

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.150
Rentarou!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:25.950
Rentarou!

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:30.450
Yes.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.000
Yes. Understood.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:35.650
Right.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:37.650
It’s all right.

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:40.300
Yes.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.500
Rentarou, it was a customer.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:46.950
Right.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.460
Soujyu, I’m thirsty.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.510
Shall I make some fresh juice?

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.250
Some warm coffee would be good.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.720
With lots of sugar in it.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:17:59.890
Okay!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.650
When I woke up,
I was in bed at the hospital.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:14.700
That squid bastard spat out a bunch of ink and vanished from the scene.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.750
Is it because it lost
the match fair and square?

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.700
Or, did it not find a way to eat peanuts through its nose?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.950
In the end, not only was squid unharmed…

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.400
but I also got these wounds…
was there any point?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.490
I also thought that way for a while.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.250
Geez.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.370
What meaningless wounds.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.400
October 25th, 1945.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.050
The GHQ’s Supreme Commander of the Allied Forces, MacArthur,

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:57.750
dismantled the Japanese Zaibatsu.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.670
And to enforce restrictions on production,

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:04.450
he ordered all concerned parties to report the details of their businesses.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:09.660
There was a GHQ memorandum concerning the top baking institutions and manufacturers.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:12.330
It was the so-called
“dismantlement of the Zaibatsu.”

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.490
We’ll come soon, Sara-chan.

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:35.050
Ika Fire is the military weapon that the Wadatsumi Facility developed.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.750
Ika Fire?

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.750
That bastard squid
you were fighting against.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.550
A-ah, I see…

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:44.100
Even Kimihiko-sama
and Sara-sama’s wedding,

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:47.690
was somehow brought about by the power of Wadatsumi.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.250
Wasn’t it the will…

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.500
Kimihiko-sama believes that it was.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:56.880
For the wedding ceremony, Kimihiko-sama and Sara-sama have journeyed to a distant country.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.800
Why are you telling me this?

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.350
I wanted to become a baseball player.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.810
But I am not a fool.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.750
Such a dream just can’t come true.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:15.320
I thought about employment, bank accounts and pensions, and I gave up.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.910
I can deal with it.

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.820
Do you think that my dream might still come true?

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.600
Of course,

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.120
if you pursue it with all you might.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:32.150
The three that are made up of one man and two women living under one roof.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:34.550
Society may have some things to say about that.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.400
But you guys are a trio.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.300
I will allow it.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.390
Of course, me too!

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:44.300
I approve as well!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.010
Me too.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.200
Three people living together?

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:49.680
Well, I’d say that’s fine.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.200
Go, Nidaime!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.900
And bring her back!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.800
Thank you very much.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.820
HOLD ON!

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:02.950
You!

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:07.550
I did not run away frightened!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.580
I had my hands full looking for a way to eat peanuts through my nose,

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.750
but that’s enough of that!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.080
I’ll burn you to death right here!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.800
Get with it!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.800
Your turn is over already!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:18.750
You’re just bluffing, you pissant!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.900
Do you think that you would defeat me,
with my indestructible body…?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:22.840
SAY WHAAAATTT?!?!?!?!

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:25.350
Ta-da!

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.810
I heard that if you get hit with this, you won’t be able to regenerate.

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:31.850
W-Why… Why do you have that…

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.170
I got it as a reward.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:44.900
Kick his ass, Nidaime.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.600
Well, this good, Ruru-chan.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.870
It’s good, Rara-chan.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:54.600
Be sure to come back with Sara-chan!

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:56.880
When you come back, it’ll be the three of you!

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.630
Nidaime! Nidaime! Nidaime! Nidaime!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.600
Nidaime, do your best!

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.000
Destination… Germany!

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:28.900
Inside my memories,

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:28.900
kioku no naka ni aru

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:35.040
there was a happy moment

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:35.040
shiawase na shunkan

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:41.010
within the light.

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:41.010
hikari no naka de ita

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:47.650
It overflowed in this place.

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:47.650
afureteta kono basho de

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.050
For example, 3 years later,

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.050
tatoeba sen nen go

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.260
would you be able

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.260
bokura no jikan wo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:01.660
to remember our time?

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:01.660
omoida ni suru koto dekiru ka na

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.500
Ah... the days gone by

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.500
aa owatta hibi ga

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:15.010
always wrench my heart.

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:15.010
KOKORO no zutto zutto shimetsuketeku

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:20.080
Hey, more than before,

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:20.080
nee mae yori motto

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:27.760
understand the feelings of love.

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:27.760
itoshiku omou kimochi wo shitte

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:34.660
I won’t say goodbye. Always from now on,

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:34.660
sayonara wa iwanai yo zutto kore kara mo

00:23:34.730 --> 00:23:39.300
the days of no return

00:23:34.730 --> 00:23:39.300
modoru koto no nai hibi

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:46.510
will leave your heart behind.

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:46.510
kokoro wo nokoshite

